I usually look at a screen all day at work.
Therefore, I would like to be completely offline now.
I go into my living room.
Here I turn on my warm reading lamp.
The light gives a very cozy atmosphere.
I sit down in my soft armchair.
I take out my new book.
It is a real paper book.
The book is opened, and the real world disappears.
The coffee beans from Nina must be saved for tomorrow morning.
Tonight I am just drinking a glass of water.
The phone is ignored for the rest of the evening.
I am relaxing completely.
Such a quiet end to the day is absolutely perfect.
